<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow, noarchive, nosnippet, noimageindex">
  <title>Extension Health Check · 服务状态</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/health-status.css">
  <script src="/javascripts/health-status.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar"><div class="brand">Extension Health Check</div><span class="live-label">URL MONITOR</span></header>
  <main>
    <section class="heading">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">SERVICE OVERVIEW</p><h1>服务运行状态</h1><p class="subtitle">所有服务的可用性，一目了然。每 3 小时自动巡检。</p></div>
    </section>
    <div id="notice" class="notice" role="status">正在加载监控数据…</div>
    <section class="cards" aria-label="监控概况">
      <article><span>监控服务</span><strong id="total">—</strong><small>normal + additional − ignore</small></article>
      <article class="healthy-card"><span>运行正常</span><strong id="healthy">—</strong><small>成功收到 HTTP 2xx 响应</small></article>
      <article class="error-card"><span>访问异常</span><strong id="errors">—</strong><small>连续两次访问失败</small></article>
      <article><span>等待检测</span><strong id="pending">—</strong><small>新增或尚未完成首次检测</small></article>
    </section>
    <section class="services">
      <div class="section-title"><h2>服务列表</h2><span id="progress"></span></div>
      <div class="toolbar">
        <input id="search" type="search" placeholder="搜索名称、URL 或分类" aria-label="搜索服务">
        <select id="type-filter" aria-label="类型"><option value="">全部类型</option><option value="normal">normal</option><option value="additional">additional</option></select>
        <select id="status-filter" aria-label="状态"><option value="">全部状态</option><option value="error">访问异常</option><option value="healthy">运行正常</option><option value="pending">等待检测</option></select>
      </div>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>服务 / URL</th><th>状态</th><th>分类</th><th>类型</th><th>HTTP / 耗时</th><th>访问时间 / 尝试次数</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody id="services"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <p id="empty" class="empty" hidden>没有符合条件的服务。</p>
    </section>
    <footer><span id="completed">上次完成：—</span><span id="next">下次检测：—</span><span>页面每 30 秒刷新 · 时间均为本地时间</span></footer>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
